1
00:00:09,200 --> 00:00:12,940
Brighten it up and step back to take a look.

2
00:00:23,160 --> 00:00:28,620
An afternoon after the rain,
as if someone is calling.

3
00:00:29,900 --> 00:00:35,300
Walking while looking back,
holding Gā-chan's hand.

4
00:00:36,180 --> 00:00:42,340
That strange feeling I had back then.

5
00:00:43,120 --> 00:00:47,700
So on the tiles of the arcade street,

6
00:00:47,700 --> 00:00:53,500
I tried walking only on the black ones.

7
00:00:55,880 --> 00:00:59,660
Everyone was a child once,

8
00:00:59,660 --> 00:01:01,800
but everyone has forgotten.

9
00:01:02,700 --> 00:01:09,080
The self-important politicians with their stern faces,
and the aunties who are a thorn in your side,

10
00:01:09,560 --> 00:01:14,660
Go on, turn that corner.

11
00:01:15,660 --> 00:01:19,880
You can meet everyone, everyone.

12
00:01:22,060 --> 00:01:27,800
Over there,
there's a turtle surely there's a turtle.

13
00:01:29,180 --> 00:01:32,980
Everyone, come on over to our town.

14
00:01:34,020 --> 00:01:34,580
Thank you.

15
00:01:35,980 --> 00:01:39,700
Circus Symphony

16
00:01:43,160 --> 00:01:46,620
What a beautiful day, senior.

17
00:01:46,620 --> 00:01:50,060
The sky is high and the horses grow fat.
Autumn is here.

18
00:01:50,760 --> 00:01:53,900
Right, I'll bet on big
brother for tomorrow's races.

19
00:01:53,900 --> 00:01:56,900
But you said 6 and 7 earlier.

20
00:01:57,800 --> 00:01:59,360
My animal instinct just kicked in.

21
00:01:59,360 --> 00:02:01,900
677 isn't a decent betting ticket.

22
00:02:03,020 --> 00:02:05,760
You're pretty irresponsible, senior.

23
00:02:10,220 --> 00:02:11,020
What's that?

24
00:02:11,860 --> 00:02:12,900
It's a circus!

25
00:02:12,900 --> 00:02:13,620
A circus.

26
00:02:13,620 --> 00:02:14,120
Yeah.

27
00:02:14,560 --> 00:02:16,900
I used to come here a lot when I was little.

28
00:02:17,400 --> 00:02:18,400
Looks fun.

29
00:02:18,400 --> 00:02:19,420
Let's go check it out.

30
00:02:33,100 --> 00:02:35,280
Hey Honda, we can get in from here!

31
00:02:35,280 --> 00:02:36,640
Is that really okay?

32
00:02:37,500 --> 00:02:39,380
Wow, it's huge!

33
00:02:40,800 --> 00:02:43,160
Senpai, what's that?

34
00:02:44,000 --> 00:02:48,360
What, you don't know? It's the star attraction of the circus,
the flying trapeze!

35
00:02:48,360 --> 00:02:51,960
Climbing up that high
for the flying trapeze...

36
00:02:51,960 --> 00:02:55,200
Just thinking about it makes me dizzy.

37
00:02:55,720 --> 00:02:57,620
Who's there? What are you doing?

38
00:02:57,620 --> 00:02:58,600
Not bad, the star act.

39
00:02:58,600 --> 00:02:59,740
Senpai, please wait!

40
00:03:12,860 --> 00:03:15,300
Honda, be more careful!

41
00:03:15,300 --> 00:03:16,620
Sorry.

42
00:03:17,960 --> 00:03:20,840
What's with that weird voice? It's creepy.

43
00:03:20,840 --> 00:03:22,100
But, senpai!

44
00:03:22,100 --> 00:03:26,780
What did I do? Look closely!

45
00:03:26,780 --> 00:03:29,360
Senpai, what's going on here?

46
00:03:32,240 --> 00:03:34,120
Yes! Snake bar!

47
00:03:34,820 --> 00:03:36,140
Snake glider!

48
00:03:40,260 --> 00:03:42,820
This size means it's a snake ball

49
00:03:42,820 --> 00:03:44,500
This is no time for jokes!

50
00:03:44,500 --> 00:03:45,760
We have to get out of here!

51
00:03:47,440 --> 00:03:51,382
Oh no, it's hard,

52
00:03:51,432 --> 00:03:54,760
hard, hard.

53
00:03:54,760 --> 00:03:55,600
Hard!

54
00:03:55,760 --> 00:03:56,200
Pochu!

55
00:03:58,520 --> 00:04:00,720
Po, pochu!

56
00:04:02,500 --> 00:04:04,100
Now's our chance, while we can!

57
00:04:11,040 --> 00:04:11,920
Saved!

58
00:04:12,460 --> 00:04:14,720
That took years off my life.

59
00:04:14,720 --> 00:04:17,100
Aren't you... Honda-kun?

60
00:04:17,100 --> 00:04:19,200
Y-yeah, that's me.

61
00:04:19,200 --> 00:04:20,900
You know Honda?

62
00:04:21,760 --> 00:04:25,380
It's me, Iwabuchi Ryuhei.
We were in middle school together.

63
00:04:30,160 --> 00:04:33,060
So you remember me now.

64
00:04:33,060 --> 00:04:34,560
Well, it's been a long time.

65
00:04:35,040 --> 00:04:35,580
Ringmaster.

66
00:04:35,580 --> 00:04:39,760
Someone suspicious was
wandering around inside the tent.

67
00:04:40,520 --> 00:04:42,000
Then there's nothing to worry about.

68
00:04:42,000 --> 00:04:43,440
He's my friend.

69
00:04:44,620 --> 00:04:45,880
I see.

70
00:04:45,880 --> 00:04:48,600
I thought you were those
thugs from Harakuro Industries.

71
00:04:49,700 --> 00:04:51,060
Sorry for the trouble.

72
00:04:53,020 --> 00:04:56,260
Wasn't your father the ringmaster?

73
00:04:57,120 --> 00:05:01,120
He passed away last year.
So I took over this circus.

74
00:05:01,760 --> 00:05:04,620
We can't talk standing here.
Why don't you come to my room?

75
00:05:08,120 --> 00:05:10,439
Ever since elementary school,
I was great at gymnastics,

76
00:05:10,489 --> 00:05:12,858
and the girls would squeal over me.

77
00:05:12,908 --> 00:05:16,100
I always envied you, you know.

78
00:05:17,780 --> 00:05:20,200
I'd been performing on stage since I was five,
after all.

79
00:05:21,000 --> 00:05:23,760
But when we had shows,
we were on the road constantly.

80
00:05:23,760 --> 00:05:25,740
So I couldn't go to school very often,

81
00:05:25,740 --> 00:05:27,480
and I didn't have many friends.

82
00:05:30,220 --> 00:05:33,200
By the way, I overheard something just now,

83
00:05:33,200 --> 00:05:35,220
something about Harakuro Industries.

84
00:05:37,260 --> 00:05:38,600
Harakuro Industries?

85
00:05:38,960 --> 00:05:41,620
They're a shady loan
shark with a bad reputation.

86
00:05:42,440 --> 00:05:44,220
As expected of the police.

87
00:05:45,080 --> 00:05:47,480
There's no point in hiding it,
so I'll come clean.

88
00:05:47,480 --> 00:05:49,920
Business has been really tough lately,

89
00:05:49,920 --> 00:05:52,560
and we've borrowed materials
from Harakuro Industries.

90
00:05:53,760 --> 00:05:54,220
The money?

91
00:05:55,400 --> 00:05:57,395
Unlike when we were kids,

92
00:05:57,445 --> 00:06:01,380
kids today might not
even get what a circus is

93
00:06:02,260 --> 00:06:05,300
It all depends on whether
the next show goes well.

94
00:06:06,700 --> 00:06:10,380
If it flops, this circus will
end up in someone else's hands.

95
00:06:10,920 --> 00:06:11,240
No way!

96
00:06:12,400 --> 00:06:15,444
This circus is in its
third generation with me,

97
00:06:15,494 --> 00:06:18,280
and there are people who've been
working here since my grandfather's time.

98
00:06:19,260 --> 00:06:22,900
I want to save it, for their sake too,

99
00:06:23,460 --> 00:06:25,580
but the audience just isn't growing.

100
00:06:26,300 --> 00:06:26,660
But...

101
00:06:27,700 --> 00:06:28,060
But what?

102
00:06:29,680 --> 00:06:31,060
No, it's nothing.

103
00:06:32,680 --> 00:06:34,180
Is Ryuhei here?

104
00:06:34,900 --> 00:06:36,980
Sorry, sir.

105
00:06:36,980 --> 00:06:38,480
It's fine, Sai-chan.

106
00:06:39,100 --> 00:06:41,540
This is my middle school classmate,

107
00:06:41,540 --> 00:06:44,360
Honda-kun and his senior, Ryotsu-san.

108
00:06:45,180 --> 00:06:45,900
Hello.

109
00:06:46,220 --> 00:06:51,980
Nice to meet you. I'm Sae Shirayuri,
Ryuhei-san's partner on the trapeze.

110
00:06:52,900 --> 00:06:53,860
Yes, nice to meet you.

111
00:06:53,860 --> 00:06:56,620
Would you like to watch our practice?

112
00:06:57,100 --> 00:07:00,560
We'll show you a special new trick
we're unveiling at the next show.

113
00:07:00,560 --> 00:07:03,900
I really want to see it! Right, senpai?

114
00:07:03,900 --> 00:07:04,200
Yeah.

115
00:07:04,340 --> 00:07:16,920
Are you really sure it'll be
alright from up that high, senpai?

116
00:07:16,920 --> 00:07:18,200
Just keep quiet and watch.

117
00:07:18,200 --> 00:07:19,560
Here we go.

118
00:07:19,560 --> 00:07:21,120
Let's go, Saya-chan.

119
00:07:21,120 --> 00:07:21,680
OK.

120
00:07:37,180 --> 00:07:38,820
Wow, that's amazing!

121
00:07:41,580 --> 00:07:42,680
Impressive!

122
00:07:43,070 --> 00:07:46,020
A feat like that takes
two people in perfect sync.

123
00:07:47,000 --> 00:07:47,660
Right.

124
00:07:47,660 --> 00:07:48,780
It's incredible.

125
00:07:49,360 --> 00:07:53,660
It's this good,
so why aren't there any customers, senpai?

126
00:07:54,460 --> 00:07:55,780
They need more publicity.

127
00:07:56,680 --> 00:07:59,880
I know, but advertising costs are steep.

128
00:08:00,900 --> 00:08:03,600
Don't worry, leave it to me.

129
00:08:04,200 --> 00:08:07,211
Alright, Honda.
Gather the whole Kameari crew.

130
00:08:07,261 --> 00:08:09,840
I'll save this circus.

131
00:08:09,900 --> 00:08:10,180
Yes.

132
00:08:11,160 --> 00:08:11,960
Thank you in advance.

133
00:08:26,580 --> 00:08:30,400
The Iwabuchi Grand Circus is now open.
We look forward to seeing you.

134
00:08:31,200 --> 00:08:31,920
First of all,

135
00:08:32,580 --> 00:08:35,540
Don't you dare!
Come see it, or you'll answer to us!

136
00:08:35,700 --> 00:08:39,056
starting at 2 o'clock today, at the
special venue on the Minami-Senju riverbank,

137
00:08:39,106 --> 00:08:41,320
it's going to be an
incredibly exciting opening!

138
00:08:41,540 --> 00:08:43,040
Please come see us!

139
00:08:51,860 --> 00:08:53,860
The customers are gathering!

140
00:08:54,260 --> 00:08:55,520
It's working wonders!

141
00:09:04,460 --> 00:09:06,080
Wow, they're coming! They're coming!

142
00:09:06,780 --> 00:09:09,020
We haven't had a crowd this big in ages!

143
00:09:17,960 --> 00:09:20,560
Boss, it's busier than I expected.

144
00:09:21,900 --> 00:09:23,780
At this rate,
the Chief's going to chew us out.

145
00:09:24,160 --> 00:09:26,060
Doesn't matter what it is,
I'm going to get in their way.

146
00:09:27,320 --> 00:09:30,620
Ladies & Gentlemen!

147
00:09:40,920 --> 00:09:43,620
Welcome to the Iwabuchi Grand Circus!

148
00:09:45,580 --> 00:09:48,060
Showtime!

149
00:09:49,520 --> 00:09:51,840
Now, please enjoy the circus!

150
00:09:56,520 --> 00:09:57,720
It vanished!

151
00:10:25,380 --> 00:10:27,120
It's a huge success, isn't it, Ryo-chan?

152
00:10:27,120 --> 00:10:30,160
Well, leave the advertising to me,
and this is what you get.

153
00:10:30,800 --> 00:10:33,000
I hope it keeps going like
this until the final show.

154
00:10:34,460 --> 00:10:35,920
As long as the crowd is responding well,
we'll be fine.

155
00:11:10,460 --> 00:11:11,820
You don't need to worry.

156
00:11:11,820 --> 00:11:13,800
See, it's nothing at all.

157
00:11:13,800 --> 00:11:14,920
That's a relief.

158
00:11:14,920 --> 00:11:16,800
We were really worried.

159
00:11:16,800 --> 00:11:18,020
Yeah, that's right.

160
00:11:18,020 --> 00:11:20,500
After all,
no matter how good the advertising is,

161
00:11:20,500 --> 00:11:23,880
if the main star is injured,
no one's going to come.

162
00:11:24,560 --> 00:11:27,020
Ryo-chan, leave the rest to Sae-san.

163
00:11:27,700 --> 00:11:28,500
Yeah, you're right.

164
00:11:28,500 --> 00:11:30,160
Please get some rest.

165
00:11:30,160 --> 00:11:30,880
Well then,

166
00:11:30,880 --> 00:11:31,480
See ya.

167
00:11:36,200 --> 00:11:37,340
Are you okay, Ryuhei?

168
00:11:43,000 --> 00:11:44,300
Thanks, Sae.

169
00:11:46,440 --> 00:11:47,980
Here you go, sorry for the wait.

170
00:11:48,440 --> 00:11:48,840
Thank you very much.

171
00:11:50,380 --> 00:11:52,920
Those two seem to be in love, don't they?

172
00:11:52,920 --> 00:11:56,460
Otherwise,
they couldn't perform in such perfect sync.

173
00:11:56,460 --> 00:11:58,300
I kind of envy them.

174
00:11:59,800 --> 00:12:01,960
Yaku, yaku! The punch was a huge success!

175
00:12:01,960 --> 00:12:03,540
With this, there's nothing to worry about.

176
00:12:04,920 --> 00:12:06,040
Thank you, senior.

177
00:12:06,420 --> 00:12:08,680
Ryo-chan,
you actually did something good for once.

178
00:12:08,680 --> 00:12:12,260
Thank you all for today.

179
00:12:13,440 --> 00:12:15,420
Thank you for your hard work.

180
00:12:15,420 --> 00:12:16,840
Count on us again, Ryo-san.

181
00:12:16,840 --> 00:12:18,360
Leave it to me.

182
00:12:18,820 --> 00:12:22,340
I hope we can pay off the
debt for their sake too.

183
00:12:23,520 --> 00:12:26,860
If that old man hears
the circus might be gone,

184
00:12:26,860 --> 00:12:29,340
he'll be so shocked he'll drop dead,
you know.

185
00:12:29,340 --> 00:12:32,140
Ryo-chan, you're going too far.

186
00:12:53,400 --> 00:12:53,740
Get us out of here!

187
00:12:55,860 --> 00:12:56,880
Right, next!

188
00:13:09,000 --> 00:13:10,640
Hello, this is Kōen-mae Police Box.

189
00:13:11,040 --> 00:13:12,600
Hello? What did you say?

190
00:13:13,120 --> 00:13:14,300
Senpai, this is serious!

191
00:13:14,740 --> 00:13:16,242
The circus's python

192
00:13:16,292 --> 00:13:18,880
is wrapped around Towasan Castle in Shibamata,
apparently.

193
00:13:18,880 --> 00:13:19,320
What?

194
00:13:19,320 --> 00:13:19,560
What?

195
00:13:19,980 --> 00:13:20,846
Ryo-chan,

196
00:13:20,896 --> 00:13:24,300
the circus bears are running
wild all over Nikkō Kaidō!

197
00:13:25,620 --> 00:13:30,780
Ryo-san, the circus monkeys have apparently
hijacked the Heisei Kanebashi Line!

198
00:13:31,160 --> 00:13:32,980
What on earth is going on?

199
00:13:35,700 --> 00:13:38,080
Who did this?

200
00:13:38,080 --> 00:13:39,112
What are we supposed to do,

201
00:13:39,162 --> 00:13:42,100
even if the customers finally come,
with this going on?

202
00:13:42,600 --> 00:13:45,640
We can't hold the circus like this.

203
00:13:46,420 --> 00:13:48,180
What do we do, Ryuhei?

204
00:13:53,820 --> 00:13:55,400
I appreciate the offer,

205
00:13:56,080 --> 00:13:58,020
but you're refusing it?

206
00:13:59,580 --> 00:14:00,440
I'm sorry.

207
00:14:00,960 --> 00:14:02,700
The world's greatest Bolshoi Circus

208
00:14:02,700 --> 00:14:05,740
is offering to recruit
you with exceptional terms.

209
00:14:06,140 --> 00:14:08,040
Think it over again.

210
00:14:08,440 --> 00:14:09,980
If you join the Bolshoi Circus,

211
00:14:09,980 --> 00:14:12,800
you'll be able to compete with masters
and skills gathered from around the world.

212
00:14:12,800 --> 00:14:15,700
It's a chance to become
the world's Iwabuchi Ryuhei.

213
00:14:15,700 --> 00:14:16,900
With all due respect,

214
00:14:17,300 --> 00:14:19,500
to me, more than the world's Bolshoi Circus,

215
00:14:19,500 --> 00:14:23,020
the Iwabuchi Circus my father
left me is more important.

216
00:14:23,800 --> 00:14:24,560
Please understand.

217
00:14:27,580 --> 00:14:27,940
Well,

218
00:14:30,080 --> 00:14:32,500
Mr. Shibuchinsky says this:

219
00:14:33,140 --> 00:14:35,440
he'll be in Japan until
the end of this week,

220
00:14:35,440 --> 00:14:38,460
so if you change your mind,
come see him anytime.

221
00:14:38,460 --> 00:14:41,040
He's apparently prepared
a suitable contract fee.

222
00:14:43,280 --> 00:14:43,640
Thank you very much.

223
00:14:46,220 --> 00:14:49,900
With that contract money, this circus
won't have to fall into other hands.

224
00:14:50,720 --> 00:14:53,420
Mr. Shibuchinsky is supposed
to leave Japan tonight.

225
00:14:53,940 --> 00:14:54,780
Ryuhei-san.

226
00:14:54,780 --> 00:14:55,540
Ringmaster.

227
00:14:56,740 --> 00:14:59,900
Anyway, we have to split up
and round up the escaped animals.

228
00:15:00,220 --> 00:15:01,380
There's no other way.

229
00:15:01,860 --> 00:15:03,240
Ryuhei is right.

230
00:15:03,620 --> 00:15:05,320
We don't have time to dawdle.

231
00:15:05,820 --> 00:15:06,680
Ryotsu-san.

232
00:15:07,760 --> 00:15:09,000
Alright, everyone, let's go!

233
00:15:09,360 --> 00:15:09,640
Right!

234
00:15:11,120 --> 00:15:12,300
Okay, let's go too.

235
00:15:19,080 --> 00:15:20,020
Ryuhei-san.

236
00:15:31,900 --> 00:15:32,940
Found them.

237
00:15:32,940 --> 00:15:34,420
Senpai, that's them.

238
00:15:34,420 --> 00:15:36,740
Alright, let's stick to the plan.

239
00:15:44,640 --> 00:15:46,180
If I break off on my own,

240
00:15:46,180 --> 00:15:48,340
everyone can keep the circus going.

241
00:15:52,060 --> 00:15:54,360
Senpai, please be careful.

242
00:15:54,360 --> 00:15:58,360
Leave it to me.
I'll pick off the monkey from right here.

243
00:16:12,020 --> 00:16:12,940
Quiet, now.

244
00:16:12,940 --> 00:16:18,540
Kaashiguremu

245
00:16:18,540 --> 00:16:21,160
It'd be a waste for those
guys to end up as bear food.

246
00:16:21,160 --> 00:16:22,860
Don't say such carefree things.

247
00:16:26,320 --> 00:16:27,240
Nice work.

248
00:16:40,960 --> 00:16:43,520
Come on, down you come, Pochi-pochi!

249
00:16:51,720 --> 00:16:53,440
Stop! Halt!

250
00:16:53,440 --> 00:16:56,500
If you don't listen,
I'll turn you into ozoni.

251
00:16:58,060 --> 00:17:01,040
Early last night, the circus that
came to perform in Minami-Senju

252
00:17:01,040 --> 00:17:04,900
had an incident where wild beasts
escaped from the Iwabuchi Circus.

253
00:17:07,220 --> 00:17:08,980
It has become a serious situation.

254
00:17:08,980 --> 00:17:12,780
From the Iwabuchi Circus, which had
been performing on the Arakawa riverbank,

255
00:17:12,780 --> 00:17:14,080
the animals have escaped.

256
00:17:18,560 --> 00:17:20,660
This has turned into a terrible mess,
hasn't it?

257
00:17:21,240 --> 00:17:23,720
Are the customers going to stop coming now?

258
00:17:23,720 --> 00:17:28,180
That went well, bro.

259
00:17:28,860 --> 00:17:30,660
Now the boss is going to praise us for this!

260
00:17:31,120 --> 00:17:33,740
Damn it, who the hell did this?

261
00:17:39,860 --> 00:17:42,140
T-this is a Haraguro Industries badge!

262
00:17:42,140 --> 00:17:43,340
Haraguro Industries?

263
00:17:43,620 --> 00:17:45,580
Whoa, we've been found out, boss!

264
00:17:45,700 --> 00:17:46,360
Run for it!

265
00:17:47,440 --> 00:17:48,780
Ryotsu, over there!

266
00:17:48,960 --> 00:17:49,600
Whoa!

267
00:17:50,520 --> 00:17:51,240
Don't let them escape!

268
00:17:56,200 --> 00:17:57,340
They're getting away!

269
00:17:57,460 --> 00:17:58,240
Damn it!

270
00:18:00,660 --> 00:18:01,160
There it is!

271
00:18:03,240 --> 00:18:04,040
There, there.

272
00:18:05,860 --> 00:18:07,220
Let's go, Ryotsu!

273
00:18:07,220 --> 00:18:08,860
Fire!

274
00:18:10,980 --> 00:18:12,580
I'm counting on you, Ryo-chan.

275
00:18:12,580 --> 00:18:14,220
Ryo-sama, you can do it!

276
00:18:31,160 --> 00:18:35,620
They confessed easily. Apparently they
really were hired by Haraguro Industries.

277
00:18:36,620 --> 00:18:42,440
Even if the culprits are caught, they've already
caused such a commotion that it can't be undone.

278
00:18:42,800 --> 00:18:43,760
What a shame.

279
00:18:48,440 --> 00:18:49,780
Look, senpai.

280
00:18:51,680 --> 00:18:52,880
Here, here!

281
00:18:52,880 --> 00:18:55,820
This is the circus the animals escaped from.

282
00:18:55,820 --> 00:18:58,980
We've never seen animals like that, have we?

283
00:19:01,340 --> 00:19:02,060
Senpai!

284
00:19:02,300 --> 00:19:04,160
Every cloud has a silver lining!

285
00:19:04,520 --> 00:19:07,920
Those animals' performance turned
out to be the perfect advertisement!

286
00:19:08,180 --> 00:19:09,280
Well done, Saori!

287
00:19:09,620 --> 00:19:11,360
Saori has nothing to do with this!

288
00:19:11,940 --> 00:19:13,660
No, they're finally going to swap.

289
00:19:14,320 --> 00:19:16,080
Alright, things are about to get busy!

290
00:19:16,540 --> 00:19:19,060
Trouble, trouble! Ryuhei-san is missing!

291
00:19:19,840 --> 00:19:20,560
What?!

292
00:19:21,220 --> 00:19:24,060
Ha ha my stomach, my stomach...

293
00:19:31,160 --> 00:19:33,420
After all these customers have come,

294
00:19:33,940 --> 00:19:38,040
how can we not show the main
trapeze act of Ryuhei and Saya?

295
00:19:38,040 --> 00:19:39,860
What should we do, senior?

296
00:19:40,760 --> 00:19:42,980
Saya, don't you know?

297
00:19:42,980 --> 00:19:45,120
Where Ryuhei has gone?

298
00:19:47,280 --> 00:19:50,100
Right now, we need to think about
the customers rather than that.

299
00:19:51,260 --> 00:19:55,160
So many customers are
coming to see our circus.

300
00:19:56,440 --> 00:19:58,940
We have to see it through to the end,
even if it's just us.

301
00:20:01,160 --> 00:20:01,480
But...

302
00:20:02,380 --> 00:20:02,780
But?

303
00:20:03,560 --> 00:20:05,480
No, it's nothing.

304
00:20:08,760 --> 00:20:10,980
That's right! Ryuhei will definitely come!

305
00:20:11,320 --> 00:20:13,900
Until then,
we must keep the show going at all costs!

306
00:20:14,120 --> 00:20:14,520
Yes!

307
00:20:27,440 --> 00:20:29,360
Nice to work with you, new ringmaster.

308
00:20:31,160 --> 00:20:33,840
A circus can't function if
even one person is missing.

309
00:20:33,840 --> 00:20:36,420
That's right. Ryuhei-san, let's do our best.

310
00:20:37,980 --> 00:20:39,980
Ryuhei-san is so careless.

311
00:20:39,980 --> 00:20:41,100
Sorry.

312
00:20:46,220 --> 00:20:49,320
He still hasn't come.
Do you think he'll be all right, senpai?

313
00:20:49,820 --> 00:20:52,640
Just be quiet and wait.
Ryuhei will definitely come.

314
00:20:53,320 --> 00:20:55,560
Trouble!
Kei-chan from the single-rope act...

315
00:20:55,560 --> 00:20:56,480
What happened?

316
00:20:58,400 --> 00:20:59,100
What is it?

317
00:20:59,100 --> 00:21:02,023
Sorry, it's hard even to stand.

318
00:21:02,073 --> 00:21:03,660
At a time like this, too.

319
00:21:04,100 --> 00:21:07,900
What do we do? She's the only one
who can perform the single-rope act.

320
00:21:08,740 --> 00:21:10,140
Alright, I'll do it.

321
00:21:11,040 --> 00:21:11,360
Ryo-chan!

322
00:21:12,160 --> 00:21:13,600
Are you all right, Ryo-chan?

323
00:21:13,760 --> 00:21:17,700
Don't worry. I got used to this
kind of thing when I was a kid.

324
00:21:20,140 --> 00:21:21,663
Thank goodness.

325
00:21:21,713 --> 00:21:24,860
With this,
you really are the world's Yabuchi Ryuhei.

326
00:21:34,180 --> 00:21:36,300
This is harder than I thought.

327
00:21:36,760 --> 00:21:38,140
Do you think Ryo-chan will be all right?

328
00:21:38,140 --> 00:21:40,420
It's a complete, no-rehearsal,
straight-to-the-show thing, isn't it?

329
00:21:40,420 --> 00:21:41,240
Ryo-sama

330
00:21:42,480 --> 00:21:43,660
What are they doing?

331
00:21:43,660 --> 00:21:44,580
What about Ryuhei-kun?

332
00:21:44,580 --> 00:21:45,080
Aaaaaah!

333
00:21:47,720 --> 00:21:49,040
Aaaaaah!

334
00:21:50,280 --> 00:21:53,040
Aaaaaah!

335
00:21:53,040 --> 00:21:54,980
Aaaaaah!

336
00:21:54,980 --> 00:21:57,160
I can't take it anymore.

337
00:21:57,160 --> 00:21:59,700
Aaaaaah!

338
00:22:00,500 --> 00:22:01,440
Here we go!

339
00:22:01,440 --> 00:22:07,920
Aaaaaaah!

340
00:22:07,920 --> 00:22:09,480
Aaaaaaah!

341
00:22:09,480 --> 00:22:11,040
Aaaaaaah!

342
00:22:11,040 --> 00:22:11,920
Aaaaaaah!

343
00:22:11,920 --> 00:22:12,580
Let's do this!

344
00:22:12,580 --> 00:22:14,060
Aaaaaaah!

345
00:22:14,760 --> 00:22:18,288
Ladies and gentlemen, thank you for waiting.
Now, the star of the circus,

346
00:22:18,338 --> 00:22:20,540
the trapeze show, is about to begin.

347
00:22:22,000 --> 00:22:23,060
Ryuhei-san!

348
00:22:24,540 --> 00:22:25,780
Ryuhei-san!

349
00:22:27,000 --> 00:22:30,000
That was close. I figured you'd show up.

350
00:22:30,720 --> 00:22:31,780
Sorry I'm late.

351
00:22:43,480 --> 00:22:44,220
Sorry.

352
00:22:44,220 --> 00:22:45,680
About this offer, after all,

353
00:22:45,680 --> 00:22:47,460
please consider it as
never having been made.

354
00:22:48,360 --> 00:22:49,380
Excuse me.

355
00:22:49,380 --> 00:22:50,600
Iwabuchi-kun

356
00:22:59,740 --> 00:23:01,540
After all, for the Ryuhei Festival,

357
00:23:01,780 --> 00:23:04,300
Sae-san is the perfect partner, isn't she?

358
00:23:05,240 --> 00:23:07,140
So beautiful and graceful,

359
00:23:07,480 --> 00:23:10,420
it's like the two of them are
playing classical music together.

360
00:23:11,560 --> 00:23:15,080
A circus is a performance where each
person's strength comes together as one.

361
00:23:15,460 --> 00:23:17,820
It's like a grand symphony, after all.

362
00:23:18,360 --> 00:23:19,960
A circus symphony

363
00:23:19,960 --> 00:23:21,740
Exactly right.

364
00:23:22,080 --> 00:23:22,400
Yes.

365
00:23:24,440 --> 00:23:27,220
No matter how hard it gets,
I won't waver anymore.

366
00:23:27,740 --> 00:23:29,740
With Sae-chan here, and everyone else too,

367
00:23:30,140 --> 00:23:31,380
and the audience coming to see us,

368
00:23:32,200 --> 00:23:33,640
this is my happiness.

369
00:23:44,620 --> 00:23:46,380
Father, please watch over me.

370
00:23:47,020 --> 00:23:48,300
I'll stand together with everyone

371
00:23:48,640 --> 00:23:51,480
and make this circus the best in the world.

372
00:24:07,500 --> 00:24:13,980
First I draw my eyebrows,
then dash to the station, dash, dash, dash!

373
00:24:13,980 --> 00:24:19,900
Circling the main line on the homeward trip,

374
00:24:20,680 --> 00:24:25,900
another tough week,
and your overwork is only natural.

375
00:24:27,100 --> 00:24:33,300
Though I'm making do with one hand,
a beef bowl with extra cloudy sauce.

376
00:24:33,300 --> 00:24:36,640
All the irritation from endless overtime,

377
00:24:36,640 --> 00:24:40,260
ylang-ylang clears it right up.

378
00:24:43,600 --> 00:24:46,400
Every day is no problem.

379
00:24:46,400 --> 00:24:50,060
Once I pass through a hot shower,

380
00:24:50,060 --> 00:24:53,060
every day is no problem.

381
00:24:53,060 --> 00:24:56,660
My energy recharges with my sleep pillow.

382
00:24:59,820 --> 00:25:02,600
Every day, no problem

383
00:25:03,520 --> 00:25:06,240
I love this version of me

384
00:25:06,240 --> 00:25:09,360
Every day, no brain

385
00:25:09,360 --> 00:25:13,100
Hearts flying on Monday

386
00:25:20,700 --> 00:25:23,060
Flying through the sky to deliver tacos?

387
00:25:23,360 --> 00:25:27,280
I see, so it won't take long
and the pay's perfect too.

388
00:25:27,780 --> 00:25:29,560
What's this black-clad group?

389
00:25:29,560 --> 00:25:31,840
Why are you getting in our way?

390
00:25:33,300 --> 00:25:34,820
Flying octopus delivery service

391
00:25:34,820 --> 00:25:37,380
It's not sudako, it's tacos!

392
00:25:38,540 --> 00:25:40,840
Over there is Kameari

393
00:25:41,780 --> 00:25:44,560
Well, surely it's Kameari

394
00:25:45,360 --> 00:25:49,200
Everybody come on over to our town

395
00:25:50,280 --> 00:25:50,780
Thank you

